ide/Debuggers/Debuggers.h: ide/Debuggers/Debuggers.h defines shared IDE debugger components, including disassembly and debug-display interfaces, supporting debugger commands, terminal handling, and source navigation.
ide/Debuggers/Gdb.h: `Gdb` is the IDE’s GDB-backed debugger controller and UI. It manages execution, breakpoints, threads and stack frames, and presents locals, watches, registers, disassembly, and memory; it also supports quick watches and session serialization.
ide/Debuggers/Pdb.h: ide/Debuggers/Pdb.h declares the PDB debugger’s core data model and interface: process and thread state, registers, stack frames, symbols, typed values, memory pages, locals, watches, and visualizers for inspecting program data.
ide/Debuggers/cvconst.h: Defines Microsoft CodeView debugging constants: calling conventions, symbol and type categories, source languages, processor IDs, and extensive register maps for many architectures, plus HLSL registers and memory/frame kinds.
